    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ualR7H5WOb_9GPKPhCt_4ijnviD9CzPasGitjg9u5bs.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned}\n& A=\\{1,3,7,9,11\\} \\\\\n& B=\\{2,4,5,7,8,10,12\\} \\\\\n& f(1)+f(3)=14\n\\end{aligned}$\n(i) $2+12$\n(ii) $4+10$\n$2 \\times(2 \\times 5 \\times 4 \\times 3)=240$",
